# Regenerable or heavy intermediates: the art and sound scripts rebuild them.
**/sound/*.wav
**/music/dist/
**/*.mp4
**/__pycache__/
# Scratch renders made while looking (crops, zooms, drafts): regenerable.
**/out/crop-*
**/out/view-*
**/out/native-*
**/out/draft-*
**/out/_look*
**/out/look*
**/out/zoom*
**/_look*/
